# Papers REAL2 — canonical rebuild
# Clean-repo hygiene. This repo holds docs + (later) app source only —
# never build output, dependencies, secrets, or personal vault data.

# --- Dependencies / build output (pre-empted; no app code yet) ---
node_modules/
dist/
build/
target/
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Secrets & credentials (NEVER commit) ---
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
auth.json
*.credentials
.git-credentials

# --- Local / editor / OS cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.log
*.tmp

# --- Code-intelligence / agent scratch (do not carry v0 tooling in by accident) ---
.gitnexus/
.claude/
scratchpad/
